# Check out text files with LF line endings on every platform, Windows included. Tests pin
# SHA-256 digests of text fixtures and parse workflow files line by line, so a CRLF checkout
# would change what they read.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.gif binary

# PHARN development tooling: the owner's build pipeline, not part of Phargus. Marked so GitHub leaves it
# out of the language statistics and collapses it in pull request diffs. None of it is published:
# package.json "files" ships dist/ only, and `npm run check:package` fails if anything else ships.
pharn/** linguist-vendored
.claude/** linguist-vendored
pharn.*.json linguist-generated
